# 行尾统一：shell 脚本必须是 LF，否则在 git-bash / Linux 下会因为 "\r" 跑不起来
*  text=auto
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text
*.md   text
*.json text

# 二进制（正常情况 .gitignore 已经把它们挡在外面，这里只是兜底）
*.gguf        binary
*.safetensors binary
*.dll         binary
*.exe         binary
*.png         binary
*.jpg         binary
*.webp        binary
*.mp4         binary
*.webm        binary
*.zip         binary
*.ico         binary
